@katomm offered a great suggestion to help find unused label numbers in https://github.com/cardano-foundation/CIPs/pull/1169#issuecomment-4153253420. 

I've inserted that with some different wrapper language & removed some old language that was grammatically incorrect & maybe no longer meaningful today:
* all `Reserved` labels through `15` — not just `0` and `1` — are currently in use;
* the "machine-readable" `registry.json` file _is also_ human readable, so the old term isn't meaningful;
* instead of "open your pull request" I've filled out that information a bit more with what editors have been requiring for these PRs.

